ong><div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Maratona<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">42\u00aa Estra Firenze Marathon<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 29 Nov \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 08:30<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 69.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 31\/03)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 79.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 30\/06)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">3\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 89.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 31\/08)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">4\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 99.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 15\/10)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">5\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 109.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 20\/11)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida 10K<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">10K Firenze Marathon<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 29 Nov \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 08:30<\/span><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Estafeta<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">3x7K Fiorentina Charity Run<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 28 Nov \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 10:00<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data e o hor\u00e1rio de partida da 42\u00aa Maratona de Floren\u00e7a 2026?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 42\u00aa Maratona de Floren\u00e7a realiza-se no domingo, 29 de novembro de 2026, com entrada nas grelhas de partida entre as 07:00 e as 08:00 e tiro de partida \u00e0s 08:30 na Piazza Duomo.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde funcionam a partida, a meta, o guarda-roupa e a Marathon Expo?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A partida e a meta situam-se na Piazza Duomo, em Floren\u00e7a (It\u00e1lia), com dep\u00f3sito de sacos na Piazza Santa Maria Novella a partir das 07:00. O levantamento de dorsais decorre na Stazione Leopolda (Viale Fratelli Rosselli) a 27 de novembro (10:00-19:30) e 28 de novembro (09:00-19:30).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e os tempos limite oficiais?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento principal de 42,195 km tem um tempo limite m\u00e1ximo de 6h00, com barreiras hor\u00e1rias \u00e0s 3h00 na passagem da Meia Maratona (21,097 km) e \u00e0s 4h15 aos 30 km. O programa inclui ainda a corrida competitiva de 10 km no domingo e a estafeta 3x7K no s\u00e1bado.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o na Maratona de Floren\u00e7a 2026?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es para os 42,195 km dividem-se em 5 fases regulamentares: 69 \u20ac (at\u00e9 31\/03), 79 \u20ac (01\/04 a 30\/06), 89 \u20ac (01\/07 a 31\/08), 99 \u20ac (01\/09 a 15\/10) e 109 \u20ac (16\/10 a 20\/11\/2026, limite de 13.000 inscritos).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Que documentos s\u00e3o exigidos aos atletas estrangeiros para participar?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">De acordo com as normas da FIDAL, atletas estrangeiros federados numa federa\u00e7\u00e3o afiliada na World Athletics devem anexar comprovativo de filia\u00e7\u00e3o; atletas n\u00e3o federados podem adquirir a Runcard FIDAL com Health Form ou participar no regime tur\u00edstico-desportivo.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"42\u00aa Maratona de Floren\u00e7a 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-11-29\", \"endDate\": \"2026-11-29\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Floren\u00e7a, It\u00e1lia\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"It\u00e1lia\", \"addressRegion\": \"It\u00e1lia\", \"addressCountry\": \"IT\"}}, \"description\": \"A 42\u00aa Maratona de Floren\u00e7a 2026 realiza-se a 29 de novembro em It\u00e1lia. Percursos de 42,195 km e 10 km com partida e meta na Piazza Duomo. Garante o dorsal!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/42-maratona-de-florenca-2026.webp\"], \"offers\": {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"42\u00aa Estra Firenze Marathon\", \"price\": \"109.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.firenzemarathon.it\/en\/home-en\/\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a data e o hor\u00e1rio de partida da 42\u00aa Maratona de Floren\u00e7a 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A 42\u00aa Maratona de Floren\u00e7a realiza-se no domingo, 29 de novembro de 2026, com entrada nas grelhas de partida entre as 07:00 e as 08:00 e tiro de partida \u00e0s 08:30 na Piazza Duomo.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde funcionam a partida, a meta, o guarda-roupa e a Marathon Expo?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A partida e a meta situam-se na Piazza Duomo, em Floren\u00e7a (It\u00e1lia), com dep\u00f3sito de sacos na Piazza Santa Maria Novella a partir das 07:00. O levantamento de dorsais decorre na Stazione Leopolda (Viale Fratelli Rosselli) a 27 de novembro (10:00-19:30) e 28 de novembro (09:00-19:30).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e os tempos limite oficiais?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento principal de 42,195 km tem um tempo limite m\u00e1ximo de 6h00, com barreiras hor\u00e1rias \u00e0s 3h00 na passagem da Meia Maratona (21,097 km) e \u00e0s 4h15 aos 30 km. O programa inclui ainda a corrida competitiva de 10 km no domingo e a estafeta 3x7K no s\u00e1bado.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o na Maratona de Floren\u00e7a 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es para os 42,195 km dividem-se em 5 fases regulamentares: 69 \u20ac (at\u00e9 31\/03), 79 \u20ac (01\/04 a 30\/06), 89 \u20ac (01\/07 a 31\/08), 99 \u20ac (01\/09 a 15\/10) e 109 \u20ac (16\/10 a 20\/11\/2026, limite de 13.000 inscritos).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Que documentos s\u00e3o exigidos aos atletas estrangeiros para participar?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"De acordo com as normas da FIDAL, atletas estrangeiros federados numa federa\u00e7\u00e3o afiliada na World Athletics devem anexar comprovativo de filia\u00e7\u00e3o; atletas n\u00e3o federados podem adquirir a Runcard FIDAL com Health Form ou participar no regime tur\u00edstico-desportivo.\"}}]}<\/script>","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":66326,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[27,28,478,31,41],"event_type_2":[627,1059],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[811],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-47350","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-florenca-italia","event_type-corrida","event_type-corrida-10-km","event_type-corridas-inferior-10","event_type-maratona","event_type-meiamaratona","event_type_2-europa","event_type_2-italia","event_type_4-solidaria-sim"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2